{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"切意象"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"切意象"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>通过序列谱</h3>\n<p>意象 $\\mathcal X$ 的切意象 $T\\mathcal X$ 可定义为 $\\mathcal X$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"序列谱","text":"序列谱"}},{"Plain":"范畴中由 $\\Omega$-谱构成的全子范畴\n$$\r\nT\\mathcal X \\hookrightarrow \\mathcal X^{\\mathrm{seq}},\r\n$$\n其构成"},{"Local":{"url":"正合局部化","text":"正合局部化"}},{"Plain":"从而是一个意象.</p>\n"}]}}